Sample tool table of the test data

This file is written for the tests of EH3D-DRILLPRO and is not a copy of any other file.

Table of Tool Data

This table contains 15 sets of entries with the format shown below.
The first data set is in line 20. The lines 1 to 19 are comments.
The tool data are separated by spaces.
Decimal delimiter is a point, not a comma.

Format:

nn                   = Tool name (2 digits, numeric)
   d.d               = Additional stroke length (mm)
       vvvv          = feed rate Z axis (mm/min)
            sssss    = Spindle speed (1/min)


